0 FILE shadow-snap.ldr
0 A cap submodel snapped onto a brick using shadow connectors
0 Name: shadow-snap.ldr
0 Author: LDraw tooling example
0 !LDRAW_ORG Model
0 // base: 3001.dat
1 4 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3001.dat
0 STEP
0 // cap: cap.ldr
1 1 0 -8 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 cap.ldr
0 NOFILE
0 FILE cap.ldr
0 A plate and brick assembled by connector snapping
0 Name: cap.ldr
0 Author: LDraw tooling example
0 !LDRAW_ORG Model
0 // plate: 3022.dat
1 16 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3022.dat
0 STEP
0 // brick: 3003.dat
1 14 0 -24 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3003.dat
0 NOFILE
